{"id":"00ee901093c12d44","group":"90","path":"90/90-df-provable.md","title":"Finite Derivability with Rule Parameters","display":"df-provable — Finite Derivability with Rule Parameters","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Diagonalization and Self-Reference","book_abbrev":"90","label":"90-df-provable","aliases":["90-df-provable"],"display":"df-provable — Finite Derivability with Rule Parameters","depends_on":["[[90-df-omega]]","[[90-df-relation]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Diagonalization and Self-Reference"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"90"},{"key":"label","html":"90-df-provable"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>90-df-provable</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-provable — Finite Derivability with Rule Parameters"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"9846c377383d14c1\" href=\"?note=9846c377383d14c1\" title=\"90-df-omega\">90-df-omega</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"4badec96813b3395\" href=\"?note=4badec96813b3395\" title=\"90-df-relation\">90-df-relation</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>固定公式域 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F\">\\(F\\)</span>、逻辑公理集 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\subseteq F\">\\(A\\subseteq F\\)</span>、有限前提规则实例关系 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal R\\subseteq F^{&lt;\\omega}\\times F\">\\(\\mathcal R\\subseteq F^{&lt;\\omega}\\times F\\)</span>，以及额外公理集 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\\subseteq F\">\\(T\\subseteq F\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\vec\\sigma\\in F^{&lt;\\omega}\">\\(\\vec\\sigma\\in F^{&lt;\\omega}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi\\in F\">\\(\\varphi\\in F\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i^r\">\\(i^r\\)</span> 为从 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"r\">\\(r\\)</span> 到 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i\">\\(i\\)</span> 的索引列集合。规则前提可以重复，但其每一个前提索引都严格早于当前行；允许零前提规则。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\\vdash_{F,A,\\mathcal R}\\varphi\">\\(T\\vdash_{F,A,\\mathcal R}\\varphi\\)</span> 是参数显式的元语言关系。原 90-df-predicate-logic 将其固定为等号一阶演算的公式域、逻辑公理及 MP/Gen 实例关系后定义无下标调用；此处不假定规则识别可计算。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{Deriv}_{F,A,\\mathcal R,T}(\\vec\\sigma)&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\exists n\\ge1\\ \\exists\\vec\\tau\\in F^n\\ \\Bigl[\\vec\\sigma=\\vec\\tau\\land\n\\forall i&lt;n\\ \\Bigl(\\tau_i\\in A\\cup T\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\lor\\exists r\\in\\mathbb N\\ \\exists\\vec j\\in i^r\\\n((\\langle\\tau_{j_0},\\ldots,\\tau_{j_{r-1}}\\rangle,\\tau_i)\\in\\mathcal R)\\Bigr)\\Bigr],\\\\\n\\operatorname{Provable}_{F,A,\\mathcal R}(T,\\varphi)&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\exists n\\ge1\\ \\exists\\vec\\sigma\\in F^n\\\n(\\operatorname{Deriv}_{F,A,\\mathcal R,T}(\\vec\\sigma)\\land\\sigma_{n-1}=\\varphi),\\\\\nT\\vdash_{F,A,\\mathcal R}\\varphi&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\\operatorname{Provable}_{F,A,\\mathcal R}(T,\\varphi),\\\\\nT\\nvdash_{F,A,\\mathcal R}\\varphi&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\\neg\\operatorname{Provable}_{F,A,\\mathcal R}(T,\\varphi).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{Deriv}_{F,A,\\mathcal R,T}(\\vec\\sigma)&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\exists n\\ge1\\ \\exists\\vec\\tau\\in F^n\\ \\Bigl[\\vec\\sigma=\\vec\\tau\\land\n\\forall i&lt;n\\ \\Bigl(\\tau_i\\in A\\cup T\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\lor\\exists r\\in\\mathbb N\\ \\exists\\vec j\\in i^r\\\n((\\langle\\tau_{j_0},\\ldots,\\tau_{j_{r-1}}\\rangle,\\tau_i)\\in\\mathcal R)\\Bigr)\\Bigr],\\\\\n\\operatorname{Provable}_{F,A,\\mathcal R}(T,\\varphi)&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\exists n\\ge1\\ \\exists\\vec\\sigma\\in F^n\\\n(\\operatorname{Deriv}_{F,A,\\mathcal R,T}(\\vec\\sigma)\\land\\sigma_{n-1}=\\varphi),\\\\\nT\\vdash_{F,A,\\mathcal R}\\varphi&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\\operatorname{Provable}_{F,A,\\mathcal R}(T,\\varphi),\\\\\nT\\nvdash_{F,A,\\mathcal R}\\varphi&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\\neg\\operatorname{Provable}_{F,A,\\mathcal R}(T,\\varphi).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>本文件依据第 90 本实际调用的接口补齐未提供的外部依赖，供本书内部使用；不声称复原未提供的外部原文。 本文件只是有限推导的基础模式，不把规则关系的并集混同于规则模式的集合，也不把可证性等同于内部算术可证性公式。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"90-df-omega","status":"resolved","id":"9846c377383d14c1","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[90-df-omega]]","embed":false},{"target":"90-df-relation","status":"resolved","id":"4badec96813b3395","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[90-df-relation]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"F","display":false},{"tex":"A\\subseteq F","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal R\\subseteq F^{<\\omega}\\times F","display":false},{"tex":"T\\subseteq F","display":false},{"tex":"\\vec\\sigma\\in F^{<\\omega}","display":false},{"tex":"\\varphi\\in F","display":false},{"tex":"i^r","display":false},{"tex":"r","display":false},{"tex":"i","display":false},{"tex":"T\\vdash_{F,A,\\mathcal R}\\varphi","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{Deriv}_{F,A,\\mathcal R,T}(\\vec\\sigma)&\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\exists n\\ge1\\ \\exists\\vec\\tau\\in F^n\\ \\Bigl[\\vec\\sigma=\\vec\\tau\\land\n\\forall i<n\\ \\Bigl(\\tau_i\\in A\\cup T\\\\\n&\\qquad\\lor\\exists r\\in\\mathbb N\\ \\exists\\vec j\\in i^r\\\n((\\langle\\tau_{j_0},\\ldots,\\tau_{j_{r-1}}\\rangle,\\tau_i)\\in\\mathcal R)\\Bigr)\\Bigr],\\\\\n\\operatorname{Provable}_{F,A,\\mathcal R}(T,\\varphi)&\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\exists n\\ge1\\ \\exists\\vec\\sigma\\in F^n\\\n(\\operatorname{Deriv}_{F,A,\\mathcal R,T}(\\vec\\sigma)\\land\\sigma_{n-1}=\\varphi),\\\\\nT\\vdash_{F,A,\\mathcal R}\\varphi&\\Longleftrightarrow\\operatorname{Provable}_{F,A,\\mathcal R}(T,\\varphi),\\\\\nT\\nvdash_{F,A,\\mathcal R}\\varphi&\\Longleftrightarrow\\neg\\operatorname{Provable}_{F,A,\\mathcal R}(T,\\varphi).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true}],"bytes":2070,"backlinks":[{"id":"5defe8d5249da268","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"953666dcda2baf50","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"3a69a5b2bc6a0fd7","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"b7d96c072a4c677f","anchor":"ref-11","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":3,"excerpt":"$T,\\Delta\\subseteq\\{\\sigma\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_L:\\operatorname{FV}(\\sigma)=\\varnothing\\}$；这实例化 [[90-df-theory]] 的句子公理集接口。下式局部推导将 [[90-df-provable]] 的参数固定为 $(F,A,\\mathcal R)=(\\mathrm{Fml}_L,\\mathrm{Ax}_{\\mathrm{FOL}},\\mathrm{Rules}_{\\mathrm{FOL}})$；后两个集合在 Assertion 中定义。"},{"id":"1c848f413742be8f","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"c8a8e90864ab15ce","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"75cf9a7e361cb7d2","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"d67f3eb689bf34b7","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"e59c38a3b7ccf012","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"34b9d9e028267d9d","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"5a383d3d0b123595","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"a2a90838812e19d9","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"7145c12676268ab1","anchor":"ref-1","locations